# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Required non-mana cast payment.
# Forcing: Lancer cannot be cast without the graveyard payment.
# AI behavior: No opponent hand or additional choices.
# Failure modes: WIN proves the intended line; timeout means payment or progression failed.
# Card roles: The spell exercises payment; the remaining creatures provide payment or a blocker.
# Protocol path: CastingTimeOptionsReq, PayCostsReq, and priority responses.
